 "code_snippet": null, "language": null}, {"company_name": "Hexaware", "source_tag": "Hexaware PGET PYQ", "subtopic_id": 13, "question_text": "Select the antonym of 'AFFLUENT':", "option_a": "Wealthy", "option_b": "Opulent", "option_c": "Impoverished", "option_d": "Prosperous", "correct_option": "C", "explanation": "'Affluent' means wealthy. Its antonym is 'impoverished' (poor).", "difficulty": "easy", "est_time_seconds": 20, "code_snippet": null, "language": null}, {"company_name": "Hexaware", "source_tag": "Hexaware PGET PYQ", "subtopic_id": 8, "question_text": "Identify the error: 'The reason why the server crashed (A) / was because the database (B) / connection pool was exhausted (C) / completely (D).'", "option_a": "Part A", "option_b": "Part B", "option_c": "Part C", "option_d": "Part D", "correct_option": "B", "explanation": "'The reason why... was because' is redundant; standard usage is 'The reason why... was that'.", "difficulty": "medium", "est_time_seconds": 35, "code_snippet": null, "language": null}, {"company_name": "Hexaware", "source_tag": "Hexaware PGET PYQ", "subtopic_id": 7, "question_text": "Read the statement: 'Automated static analysis reduces code review churn by identifying syntax and stylistic violations before pull requests reach peer reviewers.' What is the author's point?", "option_a": "Static analysis replaces the need for human reviewers.", "option_b": "Automating style checks frees human reviewers to focus on architectural logic.", "option_c": "Static analysis creates unnecessary code review delays.", "option_d": "Pull requests should never be reviewed by peers.", "correct_option": "B", "explanation": "The author highlights that offloading style checks to automation streamlines peer reviews.", "difficulty": "easy", "est_time_seconds": 35, "code_snippet": null, "language": null}, {"company_name": "Hexaware", "source_tag": "Hexaware PGET PYQ", "subtopic_id": 13, "question_text": "Select the synonym of 'RESILIENT':", "option_a": "Fragile